# Security Review Checklist

- [ ] No hardcoded secrets, tokens, or API keys
- [ ] Input validated at trust boundaries
- [ ] SQL/NoSQL queries parameterized (no string concatenation)
- [ ] Auth checks on protected routes and mutations
- [ ] Dependencies without known critical CVEs (if lockfile present)
- [ ] Sensitive paths not exposed in logs or error messages
- [ ] File uploads restricted by type and size
- [ ] CORS and cookie flags appropriate for production